% Modify to use single 1-D data table in lieu of the previous 5 3-D
% tables. Set max_num_dep_var to 20. Add macro parameters for
% xs_organization_cramd, xs_var_zone, and xs_var_bin.
%
% Revision 1.11  1996/03/01 20:21:47  dstotler
