% needed ones.
%
% Revision 1.10  1995/06/27 13:24:47  dstotler
% Begin using specific energy and temperature variable types.
%
% Revision 1.9  1995/06/12 13:07:22  karney
% Add in dummy elements into common blocks to avoid complaints from
% Alpha.
%
% Revision 1.8  1995/03/02 18:45:56  karney
% Change layout of xs_tablen arrays to be 1-d (called xs_tabn).  Define
% macros to access like a 3-d array.
%
% Revision 1.7  1995/02/01 13:44:17  dstotler
% Extend ratecalc to treat fits; modified xs class accordingly.
%
% Revision 1.6  1995/01/26 14:55:16  dstotler
% First complete version of ratecalc. Presently, input is done in
% subroutine setup_netcdf. Changes to other files at this update are for
% insertion of or changes to comments only.
%
% Revision 1.5  1994/11/21 15:52:25  dstotler
% Interim update associated with ratecalc. ratecalc.hweb and
% xsection.hweb have undergone substantial revision, but should be
% relatively stable from here on. Note also that all of the "ncreada", etc.
% macros have been combined into a single ncread macro. The user is
% responsible for ensuring that dimensions and variables are defined /
% used in the proper order (although the built-in "assert"s should
% help).
%
% Revision 1.4  1994/07/05 11:56:20  karney
% Sync with repository
